Package: bmw-nftables
Architecture: all
Depends: nftables, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Modular firewall ruleset on top of nftables
 A set of modular nftables rule files installed to /etc/nftables/.
 Include them from /etc/nftables.conf to activate the ruleset.
